ruct Vector4i' is incomplete\r\n  125 |         Vector4i swizzled_get() const { \\\r\n      |                                       ^\r\n```\r\nand many other errors, they are all part of the same. Compiler doesn't know all the implementations of all VectorN(i) classes\r\n\r\nI am out of ideas at the moment, would like to hear a suggestion","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187876714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187882534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118203#issuecomment-4187882534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118203","id":4187882534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75ngQm","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-04T22:56:57Z","updated_at":"2026-04-04T22:56:57Z","body":"In headers you can't just use operators in implementations before they are declared. Try putting your macro after those operators are declared.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187882534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188209422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118203#issuecomment-4188209422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118203","id":4188209422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75owEO","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T03:47:53Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T03:47:53Z","body":"CI is making up spelling mistakes, this is actually meant to be `arro`, not arrow\r\n<img width=\"817\" height=\"281\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e453d09-d621-4ab5-b8f2-8907899d74eb\" />