imized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189026056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118203#issuecomment-4189026056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118203","id":4189026056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75r3cI","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T15:05:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T15:14:59Z","body":"I think templates in the vector classes can be reduced, but will not bring down all 3mb down, the other place where a lot of templates are created is with each individual member accessor, so best case scenario that would be half of the size increase or less.\r\n\r\nThe [other pr](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116680) is making changes to gdscript directly, but seems to be expensive for parsing at runtime\r\n\r\n~~A third option i can think of is having global scope functions, like `zyx(variant)` this would reduce the number of members to about 1/8, but will pollute the global scope. Also, will be slower in runtime for using Variant casting, but that should be fine, is not like this members would be used extensively all the time...~~\r\n**Edit:** actually this is not a good plan because it wonly works as a getter and cannot be used as setter\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189026056/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189210991","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118203#issuecomment-4189210991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118203","id":4189210991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75sklv","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T17:11:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T22:30:49Z","body":"I reduced the template usage and reverted the docs changes to have CI working\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOn second tougth, i may have overestimated the versatility of haning an `o -> 0` member, i will open an alternative PR getting rid of those and that will reduce inmensely the size if the binary","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189210991/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]